ove to play pawn a4  trying to deflect the pawn  away from covering c4  and  i was expecting my opponent to play this  anyway after which i would play a3 and  um  yeah maybe there's still chances to win  this  but to my surprise my opponent took the  pawn  and then this just allowed um  non-stop initiative  for for me after bishop g5 the knight no  longer has the c4 square has to move and  then i win the c2 pawn hitting the  bishop  and here we see white's position  crumbling after rook a2  i win the a4 pawn  and yeah it's very very close to mate  like all i need to do is get my rook to  the b file but i can't play rook b4 just  yet so i start with rook 2 a5 hitting  the knight threatening rook to b5  um he plays knight c7  i play king d8  and then he plays bishop to c3  so as we see white's pieces are in a bit  of disarray  um knights hanging kings of target  rooks not being too useful here and i'm  still cutting the king off as well  so here i play rook 2 c5  now both minor pieces are hanging and he  had one last trick here played bishop to  b4  and uh i have to be sure not to  to cash in too quickly because if i take  the knight  uh i would be up a rook in this position  but i would also be getting mated in one  move  so i saw that and instead play rook  back to c2  and here i'm not getting mated because  of rook f8 which is what he played i  just take the knight  and uh it's me who's threatening the the  force mate with eventual rook b2 rook a2  and then the other rook to b2  uh we played on a few more moves bishop  g6  um i have to be careful not to play king  c6 because that would lead to a draw  but  king b7  rook c3 and he resigned in this position  so  yeah a very very hard fought game um a  lot of different stages in this game  between just opening preparation  the really tense middle game  the possibility of a lot of crazy  tactics  and then the end game struggle as well  so i'm i feel relieved to  come away with a win i think this this  game could have easily been a draw if  maybe my opponent  played a bit more precisely in the end  game  but  yeah can't complain i am currently two  out of four  uh beating the low rated players who  i've played and losing to a couple very  strong grand masters  so tomorrow is round five  uh it will start at 5 pm abu dhabi time  if you want to watch live i will leave a  link to the broadcast in the video  description  and yeah thanks again if you made this  far  let me know in the comments let me know  if you have any questions and i'll see  you guys in the next video
 

